    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat magical plants, explore a strange land, and uncover the <i>Legacy of</i> <i>The Botanist</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: This game is in mid-development - many of the visuals and all of the UI is unfinished</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Legacy of The Botanist</i> places you on an island inhabited by strange flora that give the player advanced powers of exploration. However, you aren't the first to discover this place. A long-gone figure known as The Botanist has left a strange infrastructure - and a dark mystery - in their wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can expect from <i>The Botanist:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The plants are magical</strong> - Each of the five plants in the botanist provide the player with a new way to navigate the world - From enhanced jumps, to sticky feet, to gravity inversion.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration is key</strong> - Short cuts, game-altering artifacts, and environmental clues mean that those with wander lust will be rewarded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gardening is optional</strong> - As you run out of the plants you find, you can always grow more with seeds from each plant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mystery is afoot</strong> - The Botanist came before you, but what did they leave behind? Hidden graves, strange plaques, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screenshots (Work in Progress):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778990/extras/404aa4157c8a0578153a34220ecaa323.avif?t=1749506016\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778990/extras/f65d4e6688cb41edb7b61f341aad61e2.avif?t=1749506016\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778990/extras/45f770ea3b7011effb9340dff1f0e1d5.avif?t=1749506016\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778990/extras/982cc41e0126e4767d4f6f605f62fe1b.avif?t=1749506016\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778990/extras/951ed2a39b1188c9cd0a4c3ad067c0b2.avif?t=1749506016\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat magical plants, explore a strange land, and uncover the <i>Legacy of</i> <i>The Botanist</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: This game is in mid-development - many of the visuals and all of the UI is unfinished</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Legacy of The Botanist</i> places you on an island inhabited by strange flora that give the player advanced powers of exploration. However, you aren't the first to discover this place. A long-gone figure known as The Botanist has left a strange infrastructure - and a dark mystery - in their wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can expect from <i>The Botanist:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The plants are magical</strong> - Each of the five plants in the botanist provide the player with a new way to navigate the world - From enhanced jumps, to sticky feet, to gravity inversion.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration is key</strong> - Short cuts, game-altering artifacts, and environmental clues mean that those with wander lust will be rewarded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gardening is optional</strong> - As you run out of the plants you find, you can always grow more with seeds from each plant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mystery is afoot</strong> - The Botanist came before you, but what did they leave behind? Hidden graves, strange plaques, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screenshots (Work in Progress):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778990/extras/404aa4157c8a0578153a34220ecaa323.avif?t=1749506016\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778990/ext